{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "RODiT Authentication API",
    "version": "2025.10.01",
    "description": "# RODiT Authentication API (servertest)\n\nReference test API for Discernible / RODiT authentication (`@rodit/rodit-auth-be` 9.x) and **CRUDA** comment storage.\n\n## Authentication\n1. `GET /api/login/timestamp` — obtain `timestamp` and `timestamp_iso` challenge pair.\n2. Sign UTF-8 `identifier + timestamp_iso` (Ed25519, base64url).\n3. `POST /api/login` — receive `jwt_token` in JSON (Bearer only; optional `New-Token` response header).\n4. Call protected routes with `Authorization: Bearer <jwt_token>`.\n5. `POST /api/logout` — invalidates session (`authenticateForLogout` allows expired JWTs with valid signature).\n\n## Errors\nApplication errors use `{ error: { code, message, details? }, requestId, timestamp }` (see `components.schemas.ErrorResponse`).\n\n## CRUDA\n`/api/cruda/*` endpoints require authentication and authorization (unchanged contract).\n      ",
    "termsOfService": "https://api.discernible.io/terms",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Discernible Inc.",
      "url": "https://api.discernible.io",
      "email": "support@rodit-tech.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Proprietary",
      "url": "https://api.discernible.io/license"
    },
    "x-api-id": "rodit-auth-api-v1"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.discernible.io:9443",
      "description": "Main (main branch)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.dihola.io:9443",
      "description": "Development (development branch)"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:8080",
      "description": "Local Node.js (direct, no nginx TLS)"
    }
  ],
  "externalDocs": {
    "description": "Additional API Documentation",
    "url": "https://docs.rodit-tech.com"
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "RODiT-JWT",
        "description": "RODiT-issued JWT from POST /api/login (`jwt_token` in body). Not a cookie session."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Unified error envelope (error-handling-standard.md).",
        "required": ["error", "requestId", "timestamp"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Machine-readable code (SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE)"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Human-readable message"
              },
              "details": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "nullable": true
              }
            }
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ULID correlation id"
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "Error": {
        "deprecated": true,
        "description": "Use ErrorResponse",
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
      },
      "RequestResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["requestId"],
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "ulid",
            "description": "Unique request identifier"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
